  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Cities Indonesia Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will support climate-resilient infrastructure development in Indonesia&#x2019;s cities, through two complementary approaches. The first is to provide support in the green infrastructure sector through project preparation and leveraging finance for a pipeline of capital projects. The second is to strengthen the enabling environment for investment and delivery of climate-resilient urban infrastructure, through the provision of technical assistance and capacity building. 

The programme aims to: (i) support the Government of Indonesia to achieve and deliver on ambitious adaptation and emissions reductions targets (ii) support sustainable economic growth in Indonesian cities, in response to the dual challenges of climate change and urbanisation.</narrative>
  </description>
